  // (O(1) latestChange check). validate: run BOTH the early-out and the full
  // walk and assert their contract — used to prove parity live in-game (on a
  // debug/asserts-on build) before enabling earlyOut. See
  // plans/2026-06-15-netdelta-dirty-version-earlyout.md.
